The Rust sources under src/ are a port of the Java sources of
Apache Commons JEXL 3.2.1 (tag rel/commons-jexl-3.2.1, commit 3118338),
retrieved from https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf/commons-jexl.git .
Each file names the Java class it ports on its first line; the grammar in
src/parser/parser_gen.rs and src/parser/parser_token_manager_gen.rs is a
mechanical translation of the ParserGeneratorCC output of Parser.jjt.

The differential fixtures under tests/data/upstream/ are JEXL sources collected
from the Apache Commons JEXL test suite at the same tag, and are likewise a
derivative work of it.

The differential test harness under oracle/ links against the unmodified
org.apache.commons:commons-jexl3:3.2.1 artifact at test time; that artifact is
not redistributed here.
